## 12.1 User

- `id`
- `display_name`, if supplied
- `email`, if required
- `preferred_language`
- `voice_output_enabled`
- `created_at`
- `updated_at`

Only necessary information should be stored.

## 12.2 Conversation

- `id`
- `user_id`
- `created_at`
- `updated_at`

## 12.3 Message

- `id`
- `conversation_id`
