# 23. Definition of Done

VoxReel AI is considered ready for its initial release only when the implemented Android application, backend, supported integrations, privacy controls, and release build have passed the agreed acceptance tests.

A written PRD, UI mockup, starter project, or successful compilation alone does not establish that every feature is implemented or production-ready.

Features that depend on third-party approval, credentials, or unavailable APIs must be clearly marked as pending until the integration has been verified.

